  },
  "longSegments": "A mapped key segment over 80 characters (long build ids) becomes its first characters + '--' + the first 16 hex of the SHA-256 of the whole segment + its extension (up to 8 characters after the last dot, kept so the kind stays the same), 80 characters in all: a valid, stable key, the same on every client."
}
